CATION": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 65, "blank": 0, "top": [["<p>Mercado Park:Mercado Way and Sierra Rd</p><p>Bruzzone Park:Mercado Way and Bruzzone Way</p>", 2], ["<p>The new Taxiway V will be located adjacent/within the existing Taxiway Whiskey One (W1) footprint at SJC Airport.</p>", 2], ["Nancy Lane Tot Lot - Florence Ave and Nancy Lane, San Jose, CA 95127<br/>", 1], ["<p>1 Paseo de San Antonio, San Jose, CA 95113</p>", 1], ["<p>Along Coyote Creek and Roberts Avenue in Southeast San Jose.</p>", 1], ["<p>Nieman Boulevard and Daniel Maloney Drive</p>", 1], ["Evans Lane", 1], ["<p>748 Story Rd, San Jose, CA, 95112, USA</p>", 1], ["The North San Pedro Park site includes North San Pedro Street between Basset Street and West Julian Street.", 1], ["1865 Monrovia Drive, San Jose, CA 95122", 1], ["3070 Remington Way, San Jose, CA 95148", 1], ["Bellevue Ave and Sanborn Avenue, San Jose, CA 95110", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "DESCRIPTION": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 60, "blank": 0, "top": [["Remove and replace existing playground equipment, install resilient surfacing and other miscellaneous items.", 5], ["<p>Design and build two public parks in the North Flea Market development site.</p><p>The scope of work for the Mercado Park includes demolition, site preparation, grading and drainage, lighting, irri", 2], ["Remove and replace existing playground equipment, install resilient surfacing and other miscellaneous items within budget for various parks.", 1], ["<p>The New Taxiway Victor- Phase 3&nbsp;Project includes approximately 164,000 SF of New Taxiway V and Taxiway V2&nbsp;connector pavement, and includes installation of drainage improvements, grading i", 1], ["<p>Relocation of underground PGE transformer to an above-surface location.&nbsp; Work is to install a smaller transformer with new feeder lines to supply the park.&nbsp; Additional work includes concr", 1], ["<p>The project is an approximately 0.45 acre site located in Southeast San Jose along Coyote Creek and Roberts Avenue. This project involves installing Stormwater Detention Basin to provide treatment ", 1], ["<p>Scope of the project includes installation of a roundabout with truck apron and bulbouts&nbsp;along all corners of the intersection.&nbsp;</p>", 1], [" The project will construct up to 100 beds with approximately 14 pre-fabricated modular buildings located on a City-owned parcel at 2090 Evans Lane.", 1], ["<p>Provide the engineering design to improve the electrical service at the lower zoo at Happy Hollow Park and Zoo.&nbsp; The improvement will include updating and upgrading all the electrical (around&", 1], ["<p>The project will be the preparation of construction documents and construction of a pedestrian-oriented linear park based on the North San Pedro Master Plan. The program includes seating, flexible ", 1], ["<p>This project will construct a site to place (1) pre-fabricated office and (2) pre-fabricated storage units,&nbsp;grading and applicable flatwork paving.</p>", 1], ["<p>The Koi Pond, Koi Pond pump, pump room and equipment sustained water damage due to the flooding of Coyote Creek in February 2017, which reached levels of 7-ft above existing grades. The Japanese Te", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "PHASE": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 5, "blank": 0, "top": [["Phase VI - Post Construction", 19], ["Phase III - Design", 19], ["Phase V - Construction", 18], ["Phase IV - Bid/Award", 8], ["Phase I - Project Feasibility", 2]], "date_fmt": null}, "CURRENTSTATUS": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 63, "blank": 1, "top": [["<p>The 30-day minimum maintenance period began on July 23, 2024. The tentaive end date for the maintenance period is August 21, 2024.&nbsp;</p>", 2], ["<p>The Consultant has completed the 65% CD design, and the City is currently reviewing the documents.</p>", 2], ["<p>The&nbsp;30-day minimum maintenance period began on 7/23/2024. The tentative end date for the maintenance period is 08/21/2024.&nbsp;</p>", 2], ["<p>Play area was&nbsp;open to the public on August 18,2023.</p>", 1], ["<p>Design is pending.&nbsp;</p>", 1], ["<p>The consultant service order is executed and posted to GILES.&nbsp; The Design NTP was issued to the consultant on 8/16/2024.</p><p>The City is currently coordinating with the consultant and owner ", 1], ["<p>Conceptual phase of the design is in progress. Encroachment Permit in progress for site boring. Additional survey data requested for the project.</p>", 1], ["<p>- 95% design package is completed</p><p>- Construction anticipated summer 2025&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>", 1], ["Construction has begun and is expected to be completed by early March.", 1], ["<p>The city recieved 13 pre-bid questions on 8/8/2024, and needed to extend the bid opening from 8/15/2024 to 8/29/2024.</p>", 1], ["<p>The project is&nbsp;expected to go to bid in early 2025.</p>", 1], ["<p>The park is opened to the public.</p>", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "DIVISION": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 4, "blank": 0, "top": [["City Facilities Architectural Services", 49], ["Airport", 11], ["Transportation & Hydraulics Services", 5], ["Transportation & Hydraulic Services", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "LASTREVIEWED": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 65, "blank": 0, "top": [["2024/08/19 14:08:39+00", 2], ["2024/08/19 14:11:43+00", 1], ["2023/04/06 08:57:49+00", 1], ["2024/08/21 21:11:01+00", 1], ["2024/08/30 12:00:15+00", 1], ["2024/08/27 09:07:03+00", 1], ["2021/02/22 00:00:00+00", 1], ["2024/08/21 21:10:50+00", 1], ["2024/08/01 19:13:28+00", 1], ["2024/08/19 14:11:58+00", 1], ["2024/08/19 14:12:12+00", 1], ["2024/08/19 14:34:57+00", 1]], "date_fmt": null}, "LASTREVIEWEDUTC": {"type": "TEXT", "distinct": 66, "blank": 0, "top": [["2024/08/19 21:08:39+00", 2], ["2024/08/19 21:11:43+00", 1], ["2023/04/06 15:57:49+00", 1], ["2024/08/22 04:11:01+00", 1], ["2024/08/30 19:00:15+00", 1], ["2024/08/27 16:07:03+00", 1], ["2021/02/22 08:00:00+00", 1], ["2024/08/22 04:10:50+00", 1], ["2024/08/02 02:13:28+00", 1], ["2024/08/19 21:11:58+00", 1], ["2024/08/19 21:12:1